msgstr "Cookies:"

#: templates/public/legal/privacy.html
msgid "see the"
msgstr "ver la"

#: templates/public/legal/privacy.html templates/public/legal/cookies.html
msgid "Cookie Policy"
msgstr "Política de cookies"

#: templates/public/legal/privacy.html
msgid "3. Purposes and legal basis"
msgstr "3. Finalidades y base jurídica"

#: templates/public/legal/privacy.html
msgid ""
"Provision of the contracted SaaS service: performance of a contract (Art. "
"6.1.b GDPR)."
msgstr ""
"Prestación del servicio SaaS contratado: ejecución de contrato (Art. 6.1.b "
"RGPD)."

#: templates/public/legal/privacy.html
msgid ""
"Invoicing and compliance with tax obligations: legal obligation (Art. 6.1.c "
"GDPR; Commercial Code, General Tax Law)."
msgstr ""
"Facturación y cumplimiento de obligaciones fiscales: obligación legal (Art. "
"6.1.c RGPD; Código de Comercio, Ley General Tributaria)."

#: templates/public/legal/privacy.html
msgid ""
"Technical support to the customer: performance of a contract (Art. 6.1.b "
"GDPR)."
msgstr "Soporte técnico al cliente: ejecución de contrato (Art. 6.1.b RGPD)."

#: templates/public/legal/privacy.html
msgid ""
"Commercial communications about similar products: legitimate interest (Art. "
"6.1.f GDPR) with the right to object at any time."
msgstr ""
"Comunicaciones comerciales sobre productos similares: interés legítimo (Art. "
"6.1.f RGPD) con derecho a oposición en cualquier momento."

#: templates/public/legal/privacy.html
msgid ""
"Marketing communications outside the above scope: explicit consent (Art. "
"6.1.a GDPR)."
msgstr ""
"Comunicaciones de marketing fuera del marco anterior: consentimiento expreso "
"(Art. 6.1.a RGPD)."

#: templates/public/legal/privacy.html
msgid ""
"Platform security and fraud prevention: legitimate interest (Art. 6.1.f "
"GDPR)."
msgstr ""
"Seguridad de la plataforma y prevención de fraude: interés legítimo (Art. "
"6.1.f RGPD)."

#: templates/public/legal/privacy.html
msgid "4. Retention periods"
msgstr "4. Plazos de conservación"

#: templates/public/legal/privacy.html
msgid ""
"Account and operational data: for the duration of the contractual "
"relationship and, after its termination, for 6 years to comply with "
"accounting and tax legal obligations (Commercial Code art. 30; General Tax "
"Law art. 66), unless erasure is requested beforehand."
msgstr ""
"Datos de cuenta y operativos: mientras dure la relación contractual y, tras "
"su finalización, durante 6 años para atender obligaciones legales contables "
"y fiscales (Código de Comercio art. 30; Ley General Tributaria art. 66), "
"salvo solicitud previa de supresión."

#: templates/public/legal/privacy.html
msgid "Billing data: 6 years from the last entry (art. 30 Commercial Code)."
msgstr ""
"Datos de facturación: 6 años desde el último asiento (art. 30 del Código de "
"Comercio)."

#: templates/public/legal/privacy.html
msgid ""
"Payer details (legal name, tax ID, address and billing email) and the "
"payment customer at Stripe: erased when you delete your account. If an "
"ERPlora invoice is still unpaid, they are kept until it is paid or "
"cancelled, and 90 days at most, because the invoice must name whom it is "
"issued to (Art. 17.3.b GDPR); on that day the unpaid invoice is cancelled. "
"The invoices already issued keep their own copy for the period above."
msgstr ""
"Datos del pagador (nombre fiscal, NIF, dirección y correo de facturación) y "
"el cliente de pago en Stripe: se borran al eliminar tu cuenta. Si queda una "
"factura de ERPlora sin pagar, se conservan hasta que se pague o se anule, y "
"como mucho 90 días, porque la factura tiene que identificar a quién se emite "
"(art. 17.3.b RGPD); ese día la factura pendiente se anula. Las facturas ya "
"emitidas guardan su propia copia durante el plazo anterior."

#: templates/public/legal/privacy.html
msgid "Marketing data: until consent is withdrawn."
msgstr "Datos de marketing: hasta retirada del consentimiento."

#: templates/public/legal/privacy.html
msgid "Technical logs: 12 months for security investigation purposes."
msgstr "Logs técnicos: 12 meses para investigación de seguridad."

#: templates/public/legal/privacy.html
msgid "5. Recipients — Data processors"
msgstr "5. Destinatarios — Encargados del tratamiento"

#: templates/public/legal/privacy.html
msgid ""
"To provide the service, we engage the following PROCESSORS, with whom we "
"have signed Art. 28 GDPR agreements:"
msgstr ""
"Para prestar el servicio, contratamos a los siguientes ENCARGADOS, con los "
"que tenemos firmados acuerdos del Art. 28 RGPD:"

#: templates/public/legal/privacy.html
msgid "Stripe Payments Europe Ltd. (Irish):"
msgstr "Stripe Payments Europe Ltd. (irlandés):"

#: templates/public/legal/privacy.html
msgid ""
"payment processing. Does NOT receive the customer's ERP data, only billing "
"data."
msgstr ""
"procesamiento de pagos. NO recibe datos del ERP del cliente, solo datos de "
"facturación."

#: templates/public/legal/privacy.html
msgid ""
"Alibaba (Netherlands) B.V. (Netherlands) — Alibaba Cloud Model Studio, "
"Germany (Frankfurt) region:"
msgstr ""
