msgstr "Suprimirlos cuando ya no sean necesarios (Art. 17)"

#: templates/public/legal/privacy.html
msgid "Restrict their processing (Art. 18)"
msgstr "Limitar su tratamiento (Art. 18)"

#: templates/public/legal/privacy.html
msgid "Port them to another controller in a structured format (Art. 20)"
msgstr "Portarlos a otro responsable en formato estructurado (Art. 20)"

#: templates/public/legal/privacy.html
msgid ""
"Object to processing based on legitimate interest or marketing (Art. 21)"
msgstr ""
"Oponerte al tratamiento basado en interés legítimo o marketing (Art. 21)"

#: templates/public/legal/privacy.html
msgid "Withdraw consent without retroactive effect (Art. 7.3)"
msgstr "Retirar consentimientos sin efecto retroactivo (Art. 7.3)"

